# 7. KNN Decision Boundary

KNN creates flexible decision boundaries.

Unlike Logistic Regression, KNN does not assume one simple linear equation.

Example:

```text
Class A     ● ● ●

      Decision regions

Class B            ▲ ▲ ▲
```

With small K, boundaries can become very irregular.

With large K, boundaries become smoother.

